@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam object {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FF
  BorderColor #2F5F8F
}

actor Domownik
object "votePanel : VotePanel" as votePanel
object "mealsScreen : MealsScreen" as mealsScreen
object "api : ApiController" as api
object "backend : BackendAPI" as backend
object "store : MealPlanStore" as store

Domownik --> votePanel : 1. wybór głosu
votePanel --> mealsScreen : 1.1 onVote(value)
mealsScreen --> api : 1.2 vote(memberId, proposalId, value)
api --> backend : 1.3 PUT /api/proposals/:id/vote
backend --> store : 1.4 castVote(memberId, proposalId, value)
store ..> backend : 1.5 zaktualizowana propozycja
backend ..> api : 1.6 200 OK + JSON
api ..> mealsScreen : 1.7 Proposal
mealsScreen --> mealsScreen : 1.8 upsert(proposal)
mealsScreen ..> Domownik : 1.9 aktualny głos i wynik

note right of store
Walidacja X-User-Id
400 Bad Request
401 Unauthorized
end note
@enduml
